Fedarchy is a Fedora-oriented adaptation of the Omarchy project.

The substantial majority of the code, configuration, themes, and documentation in
this repository originates in Omarchy:

    Omarchy — https://github.com/omacom/omarchy
    Copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson
    Licensed under the MIT License (see the notice below)

Fedarchy is an unofficial port. It is not an official Omarchy release, and it is
not endorsed by David Heinemeier Hansson or the Omarchy maintainers.

The MIT notice below is reproduced verbatim from the upstream Omarchy repository
and applies to the material inherited from that project. It is preserved here
because the MIT license requires the copyright notice and permission notice to
be included in all copies or substantial portions of the Software.

PROVENANCE NOTE FOR FEDARCHY-SPECIFIC CHANGES
---------------------------------------------
The Fedora-specific adaptations made in this repository (DNF5-based package
integration, Fedora environment assumptions, the component-selecting setup
installer, the portability corrections, and the accompanying test suites) are
distributed under the same permissive MIT terms set out below.

At the time of writing, this project has not established a named copyright
holder for those Fedora-specific modifications, and none is invented here. Until
a holder is designated, the terms below are the operative licence for the whole
of this repository.

